#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:10002
#: f762a178031443b5801816d3b0d2f4d6
msgid "Non-Gaussian Noise Analysis: Rayleigh and Gaussian-Chi"
msgstr "非ガウス雑音解析: Rayleigh と Gaussian-Chi"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:10004
#: 208571069e1c40f5ab6c7d1109696ab4
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates the implementation of a comprehensive non-"
"Gaussian noise analysis toolkit in GWexpy, based on research by Yamamura "
"(2024) and Yamamoto (2015-2016)."
msgstr ""
"このチュートリアルでは、Yamamura (2024) および Yamamoto (2015-2016) の研究に基づく、GWexpy "
"の包括的な非ガウスノイズ解析ツールキットの実装を示します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:10006
#: 3f95a57ee01b4de588e339fa82c98e43
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "目次"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:10007
#: 6ad88bd406164cc88ba07c1ae6fd7569
msgid ""
"**Noise Simulation**: Generating non-stationary and scattered light noise."
msgstr "**ノイズシミュレーション**：非定常ノイズと散乱光ノイズの生成。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:10008
#: 64e266ff79204d0b8a3de77f3fbcfb88
msgid ""
"**Rayleigh Statistics**: Testing deviations from Rayleigh distribution."
msgstr "**レイリー統計**：レイリー分布からのずれの検定。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:10009
#: 9eacaa3fccf24875b1bfb21a1d9da60f
msgid "**GauCh (Modified KS Test)**: Advanced non-Gaussianity detection."
msgstr "**GauCh（修正 KS 検定）**：高度な非ガウス性の検出。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:10010
#: a7832c5c658f494698698b978bed8257
msgid "**Student-t Indicator**: Measuring distribution tail thickness."
msgstr "**Student-t 指標**：分布の裾の厚さの測定。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:10011
#: 81363968fa8f4e4da869f332fd9b8c9d
msgid "**Data Quality Flags**: Generating veto segments automatically."
msgstr "**データ品質フラグ**：拒否区間（veto セグメント）の自動生成。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:10012
#: f3cf3219c9754c428e87d57464ef01a8
msgid "**Evaluation & Visualization**: ROC curves and composite dashboards."
msgstr "**評価と可視化**：ROC 曲線と複合ダッシュボード。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:30002
#: e059defc4d2347989319e6231e3c470b
msgid "1. Noise Simulation"
msgstr "1\\. ノイズシミュレーション"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:30003
#: 067d063fb88f40afa9d41130789bbf5c
msgid ""
"We simulate two types of non-Gaussian noise models used in KAGRA "
"characterization."
msgstr "KAGRA の特性評価で用いられる 2 種類の非ガウスノイズモデルをシミュレートします。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:30004
#: ac99a03a810d49a5a88ee30e46555d4a
msgid "**Model I**: Transient Gaussian noise (glitches)."
msgstr "**モデル I**：過渡的ガウスノイズ（グリッチ）。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:30005
#: 7ed05c711d924a5886561ac03e02ea9c
msgid "**Model II**: Scattered light noise (stationary non-Gaussianity)."
msgstr "**モデル II**：散乱光ノイズ（定常的な非ガウス性）。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:50002
#: 8d5dbe442b414d47890f219072404a7d
msgid "2. Rayleigh Spectrogram"
msgstr "2\\. レイリースペクトログラム"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:50003
#: 5299d122e2e64b53b542cd41f2464153
msgid ""
"The Rayleigh statistic $R$ measures the consistency of the ASD distribution "
"with a Rayleigh distribution. We use the `rayleigh_test` method to get a "
"p-value map."
msgstr ""
"レイリー統計量 $R$ は、ASD 分布がレイリー分布とどれだけ整合するかを測ります。`rayleigh_test` メソッドを使って p "
"値マップを取得します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:70002
#: dd098891502b43fdb1d032bcf151c64f
msgid "3. GauCh (Modified KS Test)"
msgstr "3\\. GauCh（修正 KS 検定）"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:70003
#: d61c8c20705148a08f671cb129440f1a
msgid ""
"GauCh is a more sensitive test for non-Gaussianity using a modified "
"Kolmogorov-Smirnov test."
msgstr "GauCh は、修正コルモゴロフ–スミルノフ検定を用いた、非ガウス性に対するより感度の高い検定です。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:90002
#: 30e9e9ee9b914783aa9b9626bc86b0af
msgid "4. Student-t Indicator"
msgstr "4\\. Student-t 指標"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:90003
#: 5c3a1abe77cf46909f0f048bf083afb6
msgid ""
"The Student-t indicator fits a Student-t distribution to FFT components and "
"outputs the degree of freedom $\\nu$."
msgstr "Student-t 指標は、FFT 成分に Student-t 分布をフィットし、自由度 $\\nu$ を出力します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:110002
#: c44960f859cf476881d8511f716e41f8
msgid "5. Data Quality Flags"
msgstr "5\\. データ品質フラグ"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:110003
#: b5c2ee3012bf4638a139bcb2b4b0dde2
msgid ""
"We can automatically generate veto segments where the p-value is below a "
"threshold."
msgstr "p 値がしきい値を下回る区間を、拒否区間（veto セグメント）として自動生成できます。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:130002
#: e89c89f5f0e5436d89e78328629af26e
msgid "6. Composite Dashboard"
msgstr "6\\. 複合ダッシュボード"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/rayleigh_gauch_tutorial.ipynb:130003
#: 2d21140a353d455998832f5d42ce44c8
msgid "Finally, we can visualize everything in a single dashboard."
msgstr "最後に、すべてを単一のダッシュボードで可視化できます。"
